@HostAddress = http://localhost:5012

### 1. List of batches (two are seeded on startup)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/batches

### 2. One batch (paste a batchId from the list above)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/batches/PASTE-BATCH-ID

### 3. Register a new batch -> 201 Created
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555",
  "quantity": 10,
  "expiryDate": "2027-01-31"
}

### 4. Reserve stock -> 200 OK (paste the batchId from step 3)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/batches/PASTE-BATCH-ID/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666",
  "quantity": 4
}

### 5. Reserve from the sold-out yogurt batch -> 422 (paste its batchId from step 1)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/batches/PASTE-YOGURT-BATCH-ID/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 6. Delete a batch -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/batches/PASTE-BATCH-ID